38
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:13,800
But, you know, sometimes it's not always the case.

39
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,254
The truth about order flow is that the market is

40
00:02:17,254 --> 00:02:20,199
dynamic and in a constant state of fluctuation between buyers and sellers.

41
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:24,900
Although order flow setups occur daily in the market, no two are exactly the same.

42
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:28,285
It would be much easier if every setup that occurred each time

43
00:02:28,285 --> 00:02:30,542
