45
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,400
What I mean is they may look right, but not perfect.

46
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:43,500
You're never going to get two exact setups looking exactly the same.

47
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,900
Numbers are going to be different.

48
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:46,900
Volumes involved are going to be different.

49
00:02:49,384 --> 00:02:53,584
If you are a serious order flow trader, you'll want to know when and where order flow works best.

50
00:02:53,684 --> 00:02:55,588
The information generated by the market is always

51
00:02:55,588 --> 00:02:57,254
