128
00:07:15,656 --> 00:07:18,756
When there's no more buying to support the market, what do you think will happen?

129
00:07:19,556 --> 00:07:20,729
Well, if there's no more buying,

130
00:07:20,729 --> 00:07:21,902
if there's no more support in

131
00:07:21,902 --> 00:07:24,054
the market, what's going to happen? The market's going to drop.

132
00:07:25,556 --> 00:07:30,956
The market will start to move lower sideways until one side shows their strength in the market again.

133
00:07:31,456 --> 00:07:34,556
So, you know, just think of it.

134
00:07:34,556 --> 00:07:37,856
You know, everybody's rushing to buy, buy, buy as you're making new highs.

