Where's the rest of the follow-through?

148
00:08:16,861 --> 00:08:18,530
Where's the rest of the buying?

149
00:08:18,530 --> 00:08:21,590
It's not there anymore, and the market just sells right off.

150
00:08:22,692 --> 00:08:24,939
This is a case where literally the last

151
00:08:24,939 --> 00:08:26,624
